  - memory built-in self-test
  - BIRA
  - BISR
  - redundancy repair
  - march algorithm
  - fault model
  - OpenRAM
  - sky130
  - LibreLane
  - open-source EDA
  - design for test
  - DFT
  - memory testing
  - SRAM
  - Verilator
